[00:21.880]All her life, she has seen
{"她这一生 目睹过"}
[00:24.700]All the meanest side of me
{"我最不堪的那一面"}
[00:27.430]They took away the prophet’s dream
{"他们夺走先知的梦想"}
[00:30.400]For a profit on the street
{"只为在街头谋取利益"}
[00:33.420]Now she’s stronger than you know
